USE RESTRICTIONS AND INTENT

Omnicient is intended for authorized OSINT, cybersecurity research, academic
research, threat intelligence, defensive investigations and digital footprint
analysis. It collects only publicly accessible information and deliberately
implements no authentication, session reuse, CAPTCHA bypass or rate-limit
evasion. Users are responsible for complying with applicable law, platform
terms of service and data-protection regulation in their jurisdiction.
